WEBVTT

00:13:30.329 --> 00:13:33.700
Make me laugh. Make me care.

00:13:33.724 --> 00:13:37.279
Leave out those annoying details
that nobody cares about

00:13:37.303 --> 00:13:39.652
and just get to the point.

00:13:41.049 --> 00:13:42.232
How should you start?

00:13:42.914 --> 00:13:46.626
Why don't you say,
"Listen, let me tell you a story."

00:13:48.063 --> 00:13:49.214
Thank you.